-- V2.3.14 CAUSAL HP + ORIGINAL GEOMETRY PROXY • STRUCTURAL-SAFE • OBSERVATIONAL ONLY
-- Purpose: stop treating any reliable HP drop as proof that THIS shot caused damage.
-- Adds weapon-signature compatibility, first-drop timing and a geometry proxy that keeps
-- candidate walls visible through OBB even when the local NoClip query ignores them.
-- DOES NOT access server internals, fire/alter remotes, change CollisionGroups,
-- CanQuery/CanCollide, damage, aim, projectile behavior or Bullet NoClip mechanics.

